@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<article class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 52rem;">
    <h1>Privacy and your information</h1>
    <p class="lead text-muted">
        This guide is designed to let you browse public candidate information without creating an account.
    </p>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="h4">Your preferred candidates</h2>
        <p>
            Candidates you add to your preferred list are stored in your browser's local storage on this device.
            They are not sent to or saved in the site's database. The list is specific to this browser and device,
            and may be removed if you clear browser data or use private browsing.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="h4">Browsing candidate information</h2>
        <p>
            Searching and filtering the candidate directory requests public candidate and municipality information
            from this site. Your selected candidates remain in local storage; printing creates a guide in your browser.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="h4">Administrator accounts</h2>
        <p>
            Separate administrator accounts are used to manage municipality, position, and candidate information.
            Account and election-management data are stored by the application so administrators can sign in and
            perform their assigned duties.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2 class="h4">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mb-0">
            For questions about the information displayed or an administrator account, contact the administrator
            responsible for the relevant municipality.
        </p>
    </section>
</article>
